{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act16d5_level_act16d5_st03",
  "groupId": "act16d5",
  "stageId": "act16d5_st03",
  "title": "一問之答",
  "storyCode": "WR-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "80d6bef1181b9ccd52450e6b2bc4d0aeb14acd1a4a75f29b83af203af8afac38",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......秋天了。\n山楂該很甜吧。孩子們最喜歡吃山楂了。\n......\n......又是一天。\n我還剩下多久壽命呢？\n一閉眼，就會想起很多過去的事情......\n......一夜無眠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "......夕？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "你怎麼來了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "你好像一點都不吃驚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "活到這把歲數，吃驚的情況，就少多啦......咳咳，不過和你說這個，還是小巫見大巫了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "我們......有多少年沒見過了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "記不得了，幾十年吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "......你可是夕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "你竟然還記得我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "你怎麼知道你不是在我的畫裡，度過了你這一生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "不會的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "你很自信嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "夕，你救過我，我在你的畫裡生活過那麼長的時間......我分得清。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "咳咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "這是我和你打的賭，賭我有朝一日一眼就能勘破你的畫，你的天地，還有你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "不過那日分別之後，你再也沒來見過我呀......我以為我再也沒有機會......和你說上話了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "......能這麼和我說話的人，本就不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "......這麼長時間，我經常回憶起那段日子。那座涼亭......遠離了天災、饑荒、難民的，普通的涼亭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "就像做夢一樣......咳咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "我以為，你會是個不錯的畫家。你卻一生沒有執筆。豈不是枉費了我一番教誨？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "畫家，畫家，畫之大家，見過你之後，誰還能自稱畫家？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "難得還是有一些的。都是些......奇人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "......那我可讓你失望了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "誰知道呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "說不定......你才是讓我意外的那個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "時隔多年再見......好像沒什麼話說。我人老珠黃，走完一生，你呢，卻還是那個你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "你有什麼想說的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "沒有......我......很安心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "你救了我，你給了我活下去的機會......現在在我彌留之際，你也來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "我很欣慰，夕，看看你......還是這副模樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "你的眼睛......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "我很老啦，夕，病魔折磨了我許多年......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "現在我倒想問問你......你看著認識的那些人一個個死去，你會感到寂寞嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "胡說什麼呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "那你會怎麼想？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "......偶爾會惋惜。偶爾也會感慨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "你啊......總算肯說實話了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "......還記得我和你說過的，我那被天災毀盡的家鄉嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "現在回想起來，已經太遠太遠啦......那裡是我回憶的影子，那裡已經不在我身後，他們在遙遠的前方......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "我......我從未自己執筆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "因為如果我這輩子要畫，我只會畫，咳咳，我的家鄉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "你明明什麼都記不得了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "是啊，就算去回想，除了“婆山鎮”這個名字，我也什麼都不記得了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "那裡沒什麼好回憶，但我卻總是夢到它。夢到很多個的......故鄉。你說，人這一輩子，到底想回去哪呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "......夕啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "你能幫我，畫出那婆山鎮嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "我只記得，家邊上，是座當鋪。當鋪裡的帳房先生，穿得都很漂亮，文質彬彬。小時候，我想過，我也想當個帳房先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "村子沒有那些古怪的移動地塊，農田和瓦舍肆意生長，建在哪算哪，像油菜花一樣......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "要是不小心走遠些了，就會看見遠處的山......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "那座山......我常常夢見在那裡迷路，那裡有可怕的怪物......天災雲，從山頭那邊浮現......這是我記得的最清楚的風景了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "......不用我多說，你也能感覺得到吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "當然，一點不落。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "多想讓歲月停在年輕的時候，我們在山上住，我學著你畫，偶爾幫你研墨......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "夕啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "你見過多少奇人異事，看過多少滄海桑田......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "你幫我瞧瞧看，你說我......咳咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "text": "你說我這輩子......幸福嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "喲，醒了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "......羅德島。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "我算是明白，你為什麼要把我帶到這裡來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "......都是些什麼人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "打麻將嗎？三缺一。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "你......趕緊滾出去，我是不會去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "哎，你明明興致勃勃地看了一晚上電影，這會又裝涼薄無情了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "喜歡電影也沒事，我這裡可有好些收藏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "......你那都是什麼，粗製濫造的剪貼封面，毫無意義的長命名，看了就倒胃口，快拿開！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "你怎麼能這麼說！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "......我看過不少行動檔案，這個博士是什麼人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "哦？你偷偷拿的？沒被可露希爾發現吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "你說那個年輕的魔族？她沒管我，我直接過去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "欸......憑什麼......她是不是針對我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "......羅德島。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "監察司和羅德島是什麼關係？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "那是另一件事，沒關係，別緊張。驚蟄也是貶謫之身，而且現在基本不來羅德島了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "這麼在乎她？那邊是不是有官差找過你麻煩？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "呵，不在乎這小小的監察司，倒是在乎這雷法出處......她那師父，還有總盯著我們的那些老傢伙，沒一個省事的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "你說我畫地為牢？他可是直接燒穿畫卷，焚盡眼前江山，非要來教訓我一通。我又不是你，也不曉得礙著誰了，就要挨一頓罵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "我煩他煩得要死，又拿他沒有辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "嚯嚯，還發生過這種事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "......你還沒告訴我，博士和凱爾希是什麼人？你待在這裡，和這兩人有什麼關係？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "還有，他們現在在哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "......好啊。我都告訴你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "這樣你就知道......我為什麼喜歡這個地方了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
